This directory contains local modifications made in 2026. The changes include:

- ROS 2 Humble/aarch64 build and Python installation integration;
- RoboSense RSFAIRY point-cloud and IMU support plus rs_fairy configuration;
- initial-pose-driven ICP localization and transform-fusion updates;
- configurable base-yaw and localization-frame handling;
- gravity-aligned FAST-LIO behavior shared with the mapping package; and
- shutdown/file-handle safety fixes.

The obsolete Livox demonstration launcher is not part of the production
RoboSense navigation chain. The modified source form, build scripts, interface
definitions, this notice, and the GPLv2 license must accompany a distributed
binary of this derivative. This notice does not alter the upstream license or
